Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:10.10,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about Kirschblüte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:57.10,Main,H,0,0,0,,Here's the real pig \Nthat lives outside the Gran Mur!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:02:00.09,Dates,H,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,471)}June 13th,  Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:01:59.79,Main Top,Theo,0,0,0,,That's not funny, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:02.55,Main,H,0,0,0,,Looks like that didn't go over well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:04.10,Main,H,0,0,0,,You're supposed to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:06.95,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,I don't think that was in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:10.32,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Where's Anju, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.98,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,I need her to take my turn making dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:15.48,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,She's on cleaning duty today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:17.92,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,You would know, huh, Daiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:20.47,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,All the other girls went, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.47,0:02:22.10,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,When was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:24.79,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Right after breakfast, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:26.23,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,It's lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:29.83,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Yeah, it shouldn't take that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:31.22,Main,H,0,0,0,,So they're bathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:33.00,Main,H,0,0,0,,And right now, the river is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:34.62,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Heaven on earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:37.76,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,No, no! Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.43,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,Don't be such a stick in the mud!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:43.51,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,We might die tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:45.55,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,You say that all the time, Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:48.04,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Got it. We won't look at Anju.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:49.30,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,No, you'll definitely see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:52.09,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,And that's not the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:53.24,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,I'm not going!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:54.73,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.23,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Before we're each men and women, \Nwe're all staunch comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:03:00.31,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Staunch comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:06.08,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,It's so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:10.69,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,It feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:14.72,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Kaie, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.95,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Stop sitting there and join in the fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:20.65,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I don't know. I think I can\N look sexy just fine over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:21.95,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:24.67,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,You could look at this place as heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:29.32,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Just join in the fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:31.12,Main,All,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:34.87,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Is it okay for us to be \Nout here having fun, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:37.60,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,You're so serious sometimes, Kaie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.08,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:41.03,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,We cleaned up like we were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.73,Main,Mikuri,0,0,0,,And Shin knew we would do this \Nwhen he gave the okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:46.86,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,Our captain does understand that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:49.11,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,even if he never changes expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:52.94,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,Sorry, I should've realized!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:55.32,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,Both you and Shin don't have any duties today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:59.00,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,so we should've given you \Nan excuse to be alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:00.46,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:02.19,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:06.39,Main,Myna,0,0,0,,What do you like about that guy? \NI can never tell what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:10.10,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I said it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:12.65,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,What about you, Kaie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:16.78,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Shin? He's not bad, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:19.64,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,He's the silent type. Stoic. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.23,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,W-Wait! Kaie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:22.88,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I see. I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:28.64,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,If nobody else is interested, \NI can go after him myself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:33.26,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll try some traditional \NEastern "yobai" tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:36.41,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,K-Kaie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:41.30,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Um, well... I don't really care \Nabout Shin in the slightest, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.89,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I don't think that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.89,0:04:50.18,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,You know, an Eastern lady \Nshould be dignified and reserved, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:52.43,Main,All,0,0,0,,You're so cute, Kurena!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:55.94,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:00.96,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:02.82,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,This isn't okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.24,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,You're staring more than we are, Daiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:07.38,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,Why are you here, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.11,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,To keep an eye on you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:12.83,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Multiple targets... Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:13.95,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:15.53,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:19.74,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.68,0:05:25.42,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Hey... wait. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:32.64,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,Daiya...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.02,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,You will be missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:35.11,Main,Girls,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:36.51,Main,Girls,0,0,0,,You pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:37.35,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Stay out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.23,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:44.13,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,What is it, Daiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:50.08,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,You can say, "Are you okay?" \Nin a cute voice, you know, Anju.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:53.44,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Oh, my. {\i1}Are you okay, Daiya?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:55.88,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,The rest of you need to show yourselves, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.05,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:58.93,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,Theo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:03.54,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,So, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:06.67,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Well, um... you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:07.42,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Right, Haruto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:08.68,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,Right, Daiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:10.11,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:12.11,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.11,0:06:12.93,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:14.89,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,There was something we wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:17.59,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Why didn't you just use your Para-RAID?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.59,0:06:22.28,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Well, we wouldn't want to interrupt the fun \Nyou girls were having, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:26.28,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,It'd be awkward if you were\N talking about romance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:30.60,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,For example, if Kurena \Nwere saying, "I love Shin!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:33.78,Main,Myna,0,0,0,,She {\i1}was{\i0} just saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:35.42,Main,Mikuri,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:38.91,Main,Mikuri,0,0,0,,Let's have her say that \Nright before we think Shin will connect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:41.20,Main,Mikuri,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the reaction!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:42.91,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,Kurena's reaction, you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:44.48,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,You can't expect anything from Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:47.38,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,That Reaper won't even raise an eyebrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.68,Main,Rekka,0,0,0,,He's no fun at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:51.42,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I did not say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:53.61,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Stop it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:55.47,Main,All,0,0,0,,You're so cute, Kurena!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:02.02,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,So, what did you want to ask us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:03.04,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:03.78,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,Daiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:05.28,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:07.02,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Well... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:11.89,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,What is "yobai"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:14.17,Main,Background,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:15.34,Main,Background,0,0,0,,I said sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:17.30,Main Top,Anju,0,0,0,,We need to retrieve the clean clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:17.11,Main,Background,0,0,0,,Where's Daiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:17.69,Main,Background,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.69,0:07:18.87,Main,Background,0,0,0,,Daiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:21.21,Main Top,Anju,0,0,0,,Hey Daiya, will you carry the wash for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:23.27,Main Top,Anju,0,0,0,,Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.27,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Um, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:31.00,Main,S,0,0,0,,There was a rat. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:32.11,Italics,L,0,0,0,,A rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:34.35,Main,S,0,0,0,,You can try harder than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.88,Italics,L,0,0,0,,There are rats?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:40.04,Main,S,0,0,0,,There are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.89,0:07:42.80,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Kurena...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:47.01,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Why does he talk \Nwith that woman every night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:50.74,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,He should be spending that time \Nwith the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:53.18,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,We might die tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.27,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,It's just for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:58.53,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,The princess will stop calling eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:01.06,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,They're both just killing time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:04.74,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,But why even bother being nice \Nto a white pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:08.32,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Shin should just break her already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:11.48,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Shin doesn't want to break any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:14.82,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,And could you tell that to Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:18.00,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,You don't like her, \Nso you want him to break her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:19.30,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,Could you say that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:22.12,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:25.34,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,But I still hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:28.78,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Those white pigs killed my mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:31.86,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,They used them as target practice, like garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:34.50,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,All white pigs are scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.83,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.59,0:08:46.66,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Really, Kirschblüte?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:52.47,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Yeah. All these stars came falling down \Nfrom the sky like rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:55.69,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,There were streaks of light \Nacross the whole sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:58.21,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,It was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:01.47,Italics,L,0,0,0,,There were really that many shooting stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:04.37,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Yes, I couldn't count them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:05.62,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,A meteor shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:06.93,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I've seen one of those, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:08.57,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:14.39,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it was in the middle of a battlefield, \Nwhere both my side and the enemy were annihilated,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:16.61,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,and there was only a single man beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:18.63,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Right, Undertaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:21.86,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Well, that's not very romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:26.10,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,And to top it off, \Nour Juggernauts all ran out of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:30.58,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Until Fido came back \Nfrom wherever he went and found us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.04,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,we couldn't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.31,0:09:33.92,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Fido?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:35.33,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Our dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:37.64,Italics,L,0,0,0,,You have a dog, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:42.31,Main,Daiya,0,0,0,,It's a very unusual dog. \NIt doesn't go, "woof." It goes, "beep.""
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:43.13,Italics,L,0,0,0,,"Beep"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:48.32,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Nights on the battlefield \Nare so dark that it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.37,0:09:56.94,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,And then these pale, silent lights began to fall \Nfrom the sky, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:10:02.62,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I remember I said something weird then, \Nand it was the biggest mistake of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:04.70,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,What did you say, show-off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:06.20,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I'm not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:07.58,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,If the—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.73,Main,S,0,0,0,,{\an8}"If the last thing I see is this,"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:10.08,Main,S,0,0,0,,"then maybe that's not so bad."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:17.09,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Why did you have to tell her? Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.59,0:10:20.19,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,He just snorted!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:23.02,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I doubt we'll ever see something \Nlike that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:26.25,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I wish I could've seen \Nthat meteor shower, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:28.61,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,You couldn't see it where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:31.53,Italics,L,0,0,0,,The lights in town don't shut off at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:34.87,Italics,L,0,0,0,,You can't really see the stars here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.87,0:10:38.27,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,You're right, now that I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:41.81,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Nights here are really dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.81,0:10:44.73,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,There aren't a lot of people here, \Nand we're far from everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:47.66,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,And we shut off all the lights \Nwhen we sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:50.64,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,So the stars are usually out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:54.03,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,That's one of the good things \Nabout this life, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:55.85,Italics,L,0,0,0,,One of the good things?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.85,0:10:56.57,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:03.79,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Kirschblüte, do you hate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:06.50,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:10.10,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Of course, it hurts being discriminated against, \Nand it makes me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:13.47,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Life in the camps was hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:16.10,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,And I'll always be scared when I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.52,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,So as for the people who forced this on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:25.08,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,and say it was okay since the Eighty-Six\N are livestock and not human...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:27.08,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:27.92,Italics,L,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:33.26,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,But I know that not all you Alba are bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:38.67,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Just like how not all Eighty-Six are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:43.75,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I was one of the rarer races \Namong the Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:48.09,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,A lot of stuff happened at the camps,\N and in my previous units.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:50.15,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Of course, I wasn't the only one \Nwho experienced that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:53.12,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I'm sure that there are good Alba, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:56.26,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Not that I've ever met any.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.03,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,But a few of my comrades have met them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:11:59.67,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,So I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:04.96,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,So I won't hate you \Njust because you're an Alba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.44,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:10.08,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I need to thank them, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:13.99,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:16.76,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I'm taking a bit of an interest in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:18.34,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:22.36,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Can I ask you something, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:24.23,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Yes, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:31.98,Dates,L,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,480)}June 13th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:34.12,Main Top,A,0,0,0,,Why am I doing this, Lena?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:35.74,Main,L,0,0,0,,I bought you lunch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:38.13,Main,A,0,0,0,,You'd better buy dinner as well, \Nor it's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:41.06,Main,A,0,0,0,,What do you need a map for, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:42.99,Main,L,0,0,0,,I want to send it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:46.01,Main,L,0,0,0,,They're fighting without any good maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:48.66,Main,A,0,0,0,,You're bragging about them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.68,Main,L,0,0,0,,Well, they're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.75,Main,L,0,0,0,,They've been in more battles \Nthan the other units
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:55.54,Main,L,0,0,0,,in the past two weeks, \Nand they still have zero casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:57.87,Main,A,0,0,0,,Yeah, amazing. Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:13:02.07,Main,A,0,0,0,,But would it kill you to tell me \Nabout a guy who I can actually see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:05.40,Main,A,0,0,0,,I'm having an awful time. \NThis new potential marriage partner...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:07.26,Main,L,0,0,0,,Theobald?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:09.26,Main,A,0,0,0,,How long ago was that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:10.38,Main,A,0,0,0,,Humbert!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:12.52,Main,A,0,0,0,,His forehead goes up to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:14.63,Main,A,0,0,0,,And he just won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:18.38,Main,A,0,0,0,,I made a huge mistake giving him \Nthat handkerchief when we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:20.27,Main,A,0,0,0,,He was sweaty all the way up to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:21.73,Main,A,0,0,0,,It bothers you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:23.94,Main,L,0,0,0,,Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:27.74,Main,L,0,0,0,,How do they know \Nwhen the Legion are going to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.01,Main,A,0,0,0,,She's not listening at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:31.15,Main,L,0,0,0,,It really is a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.78,Main,L,0,0,0,,They're always ready to fight \Nbefore the enemy even shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:37.96,Main,A,0,0,0,,Lena, don't get involved any deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.47,Main,A,0,0,0,,They're Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:41.52,Main,L,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:45.48,Main,L,0,0,0,,We're all humans. \NWe have a relationship of trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:46.92,Main,L,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:51.01,Main,L,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:54.37,Main,A,0,0,0,,I trust you, Major Milizé.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:55.16,Main,A,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.51,Main,L,0,0,0,,You found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.51,0:13:58.96,Main,A,0,0,0,,You owe me dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.15,Main,L,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.99,Main,L,0,0,0,,Now I can help them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:05.18,Main,A,0,0,0,,You can't even see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:09.00,Main,L,0,0,0,,Para-RAID, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:13.29,Main,L,0,0,0,,Synchronization target: Spearhead Processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:18.75,Main,L,0,0,0,,Thank you all for your work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.64,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Thank you, Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:22.34,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.20,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Thanks for your call, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:31.50,Main,L,0,0,0,,Undertaker. First, the arrival date for the resupply \Nyou requested the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.11,0:14:38.33,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it's going \Nto take a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:41.24,Main,L,0,0,0,,Is that a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:43.33,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Yeah. We keep it at the barracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:45.32,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,I'm the one who found it, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.81,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Right after I got here, \Nit was crying in front of a house
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:50.78,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,that'd been blown away by a tank round.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:54.92,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Its parents and siblings got flattened, \Nbut it was just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:59.61,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,And for some reason, it's taken more of a liking \Nto Undertaker than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:01.82,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,He doesn't play with it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:06.15,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,It rubs up against him all the time, \Nand he just pats it once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:10.01,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,I think it's more like \Nit thinks he's a good bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:11.64,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,I mean... Just look at it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:14.62,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Yeah, it doesn't move when he's reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:17.92,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,It'll never get along with\N Black Dog, though. He's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:19.62,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,That's mean! And not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:20.97,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,I demand you take that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.97,0:15:22.82,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Boo! Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.85,Main,L,0,0,0,,What's its name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.85,0:15:25.32,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Blackie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:25.89,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Whitey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.89,0:15:26.23,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Two-Tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:26.69,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:27.50,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:28.37,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Remarque.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:33.83,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Don't name it after the author of\N whatever book you're reading now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:36.94,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,And what are you even reading? \NYou have such bad taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:38.24,Main,L,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:39.84,Main,L,0,0,0,,Are there are a lot of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.20,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Were you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:42.34,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,There's just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:46.23,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,It's a black cat with white paws.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:49.31,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,So it's called Blackie \Nor Whitey or Two-Tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:51.94,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,It doesn't really have a particular name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:55.62,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Everybody just calls it whatever\N they feel like at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:59.67,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Lately, it's started coming whenever\N you look at it and say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:01.17,Main,L,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:03.24,Main,L,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:08.06,Main,L,0,0,0,,Um, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.06,0:16:09.52,Italics,S,0,0,0,,There was a rat. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:10.58,Italics,L,0,0,0,,A rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:12.77,Italics,L,0,0,0,,You have a dog, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:15.35,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,It's a very unusual dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:20.43,Main,L,0,0,0,,I wish I could've seen \Nthat meteor shower, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:22.80,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,You couldn't see it where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:25.70,Main,L,0,0,0,,I need to thank them, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:28.32,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:31.12,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,I'm taking a bit of an interest in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.69,Main,L,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.69,0:16:36.43,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Can I ask you something, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:38.31,Main,L,0,0,0,,Yes, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:42.31,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Why do you care about us so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.19,0:16:46.47,Main,L,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:52.46,Main,L,0,0,0,,A long time ago, I was saved \Non the battlefield by a Processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:55.53,Main,L,0,0,0,,He said to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.53,0:16:59.09,Main,L,0,0,0,,"We are members of the Republic. \NWe were born here and grew up here."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.09,0:17:02.63,Main,L,0,0,0,,"It's a citizen's duty to protect his country. \NI'm proud to do it."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:04.83,Main,L,0,0,0,,"That's why we fight."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.49,0:17:10.90,Main,L,0,0,0,,I think we need to live up \Nto the example set by his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:14.88,Main,L,0,0,0,,We ask you to fight, \Nbut don't even watch you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:17.51,Main,L,0,0,0,,We don't try to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:19.63,Main,L,0,0,0,,That goes against what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:22.09,Main,L,0,0,0,,And it's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.21,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.65,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,You're a virgin, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:33.76,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't mean to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:35.03,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,I meant, "like a virgin"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:36.86,Italics Top,Daiya,0,0,0,,That's not any better!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:41.38,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,I mean, um... like a young girl who thinks \Nthe whole world is made of fields of flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:45.58,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Like you have an untarnished, pure ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:46.61,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:48.61,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,What I wanted to say is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.28,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,You're not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:53.99,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,So I'm going to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.91,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,You aren't cut out for that job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:00.71,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,And you shouldn't get involved with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:04.54,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,We're not fighting \Nfor noble reasons like those.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:08.05,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,So there's no need for you to talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:12.44,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,You should get someone else \Nto take your place before you regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:17.57,Dates,Kaie,0,0,0,,June 15th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.57,Main Top,L,0,0,0,,Handler One to all units.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.48,Main,L,0,0,0,,Enemy sighted on radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.48,0:18:20.43,Main,L,0,0,0,,Enemy size is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:22.31,Italics,S,0,0,0,,We're aware, Handler One.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:24.56,Italics,S,0,0,0,,We are prepared to engage at point 478.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:27.20,Main,L,0,0,0,,Roger that, Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:30.71,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Undertaker, Gunslinger in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:33.43,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Laughing Fox to Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.11,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Third Platoon in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:42.18,Main,L,0,0,0,,Undertaker, please move Gunslinger 500 \Nfrom her present position. Direction 2 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.96,Main,L,0,0,0,,You can't see it where you are, \Nbut there's high ground there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.08,Main,L,0,0,0,,You can use the hill to provide cover,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:49.44,Main,L,0,0,0,,and you'll have a wider view.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:50.63,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Confirming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:53.51,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Gunslinger, can you see the point \Nfrom where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.64,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:57.92,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:18:58.99,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:04.03,Main,L,0,0,0,,You'll be in the opposite position \Nfrom the First Platoon, your main attackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:06.52,Main,L,0,0,0,,When you move from the suppressive fire \Nphase to defeat in detail,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:09.46,Main,L,0,0,0,,it should help camouflage your main unit's position \Nat the start of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:11.95,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,A decoy, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.66,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,You've got a voice like a little princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:14.89,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,but that's pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:17.14,Main,L,0,0,0,,Löwes can't fire at an elevated angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.14,0:19:20.42,Main,L,0,0,0,,They can't bombard her directly \Nwhile she's there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:21.80,Main,L,0,0,0,,and when she shifts bombardment positions—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:22.65,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:26.38,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,It's not a bad idea. \NRight, Gunslinger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.01,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'll do anything, if it'll help the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:31.64,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Did you find a new map?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:33.02,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,That's helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:36.23,Main,L,0,0,0,,Should I send it later?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:40.28,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Is that okay? Sending classified information \Nsuch as a map to Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:41.81,Main,L,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.81,0:19:44.65,Main,L,0,0,0,,What good is information\N if you don't use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:48.16,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,You think so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:52.30,Main,L,0,0,0,,And you're not Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:55.27,Main,L,0,0,0,,At least, I've never called you—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:56.61,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:57.42,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:06.26,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Target down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:07.94,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Fourth Platoon is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.66,0:20:11.78,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,What's that Löwe doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:15.15,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,Leukosia. I'll hit it from the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.07,Italics,Lena,0,0,0,,Back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:18.18,Italics,Mikuri,0,0,0,,Roger, Kirschblüte.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:22.42,Main,L,0,0,0,,Not that way! Kirschblüte!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.46,0:20:25.19,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Wetlands? Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:26.58,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:32.61,Italics,L,0,0,0,,No. I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:29.97,Main,L,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:33.55,Main,L,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:40.44,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about Kirschblüte.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.67,0:21:44.26,Main,L,0,0,0,,If I'd only found the map sooner...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:48.22,Main,L,0,0,0,,If I'd only done a better job...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:53.18,Italics,They,0,0,0,,"Sorry"? Sorry about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:56.41,Italics,They,0,0,0,,From your perspective, \Nthe deaths of a few Eighty-Six
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.41,0:22:01.38,Italics,They,0,0,0,,are things you can forget \Nby the time you go home for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:04.44,Italics,They,0,0,0,,Sure, we don't have much to do here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:07.26,Italics,They,0,0,0,,so when nothing's going on, \Nwe can play along with this act where you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:11.85,Italics,They,0,0,0,,"I don't discriminate even if other people do. \NI don't treat you as pigs."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.85,0:22:16.29,Italics,They,0,0,0,,But we just lost one of our comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:21.03,Italics,They,0,0,0,,Understand that we don't have time \Nto deal with your hypocrisy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:21.51,Main,L,0,0,0,,Hypocrisy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.51,0:22:25.84,Italics,They,0,0,0,,Or what, did you think we don't care \Nwhen one of our own dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:27.78,Italics,They,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:31.11,Italics,They,0,0,0,,After all, we're not \Nhigh-minded humans like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.11,0:22:33.11,Italics,They,0,0,0,,We're pigs, less than human!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.11,0:22:36.26,Main,L,0,0,0,,N-No! I didn't—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:38.51,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Don't try to deny it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.51,0:22:42.17,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,You throw us out here on the battlefield \Nand treat us like weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.17,0:22:47.63,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,while you get to watch from your\N warm and safe place inside the walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:49.44,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,and it doesn't bother you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:52.39,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,If that's not treating us\N like pigs, what is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.98,0:22:57.47,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,You've never called us "Eighty-Six." \NBut all that means is you've left it unsaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.47,0:23:01.46,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Do you think we're out here fighting \Nbecause we want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.70,0:23:05.46,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,You locked us out here! Forced us to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:08.59,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,You've caused the deaths of millions \Nover the last nine years!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:10.55,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,And you do nothing to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.55,0:23:12.98,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,You think that if you just act nice \Nand talk to us every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.98,0:23:16.28,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,that counts as treating us \Nas human, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:22.95,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,You've never even asked us \Nfor our real names!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:37.70,Main,,0,0,0,,"Real Name."
